@startuml
title QoS Management Enable Settings Paths

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "NBAPI caller" as Caller
actor "WFA-CA UCC" as UCC
participant "BSS.SetQoSManagement()" as NBAPI
participant "controller::db" as CDB
participant "agent_monitoring_task" as AMT
participant "cACTION_CONTROL_BSS_SET_\nQOS_MANAGEMENT_REQUEST" as VSCTRL
participant "BackhaulManager" as BHM
participant "son_slave_thread" as SST
participant "cACTION_APMANAGER_BSS_SET_\nQOS_MANAGEMENT_REQUEST" as VSAPM
participant "AP manager" as APM
participant "ap_wlan_hal_whm" as WHM
participant "QoS Management\nobject" as QOS_MGMT

Caller -> NBAPI : SetQoSManagement(\nQosMapEnable,\nMSCSEnable,\nSCSEnable,\nDSCPPolicyEnable,\nSCSTrafficDescriptionEnable)
NBAPI -> CDB : validate BSSID scope
NBAPI -> CDB : update BSS.SetQoSManagementInput.\npreserving omitted values
NBAPI -> AMT : CONFIGURE_QOS
AMT -> CDB : get BSS QoS settings owned by this agent
AMT -> VSCTRL : send per-BSS settings message\nBSSID + MSCSEnable + SCSEnable
VSCTRL -> SST : controller-owned settings request
SST -> VSAPM : create AP-manager request
VSAPM -> APM : deliver settings
APM -> WHM : set_qos_management_settings(BSSID,\nMSCSEnable, SCSEnable)
WHM -> QOS_MGMT : update_object() on AP path

== Certification dev_set_config path ==

UCC -> BHM : dev_set_config(mscs=enable|disable,\nscs=enable|disable[, backhaul=...])
BHM -> BHM : parse and store pending settings
alt agent socket connected
  loop for known radios
    BHM -> VSCTRL : send radio-scoped settings\nzero BSSID + radio_mac
    VSCTRL -> SST : local control request
    SST -> VSAPM : create AP-manager request
    VSAPM -> APM : deliver settings
    APM -> APM : zero BSSID means\ncache pending settings and\napply to current fronthaul VAPs
    APM -> WHM : set_qos_management_settings(each fronthaul BSSID,\nMSCSEnable, SCSEnable)
    WHM -> QOS_MGMT : update_object() on AP path
  end
else agent socket not connected
  BHM -> BHM : defer until AP enable flow
end

APM -> APM : on later AP_ENABLED,\napply cached settings to new fronthaul VAP

note right of VSCTRL
VS path carries only BSS enable settings.
Descriptor and policy use standard TLVs.
end note

note right of QOS_MGMT
Controller state persists even if the
backend does not support apply.

Accepted today: MSCSEnable / SCSEnable.
Other SetQoSManagement inputs are rejected.
dev_set_config uses the same AP-manager path.
end note

@enduml
